      "writtenOn": "2020-01-10T14:18:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the Hafnium/SPCI driver is loaded then this will clash with the buffers it has already registered. We\u0027ll need to co-ordinate between the two. Probably what we should do is have a common SPCI driver that does the buffer set-up and provides an interface that both the Trusty driver and the higher-level Hafnium driver can use. That can wait for a later commit though, once we have this working.",
      "revId": "c80efd821ed9ce80688fb1c22d1e1b64fa5d94a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
