        "id": 1000205
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-13T22:58:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently the smc number used here does not match the spec as is uses entity 62 instead of 4 (SMC_ENTITY_STD). The api I use in atf to register my handler takes a range of entities, so I selected an unused entity. It would be possible to have separate buffers registered for both drivers of we choose to stay with this scheme.",
      "parentUuid": "764db4ca_afa16e5f",
      "revId": "c80efd821ed9ce80688fb1c22d1e1b64fa5d94a4",
